        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "The first step in building the data preparation pipeline is to separate the target variable (`median_house_value`) from the features in the `strat_train_set`. This is a standard practice in machine learning to clearly define what we are trying to predict (labels) and what we are using to predict it (features). I will also create a copy of `housing_features` without the categorical column `ocean_proximity` to facilitate initial numerical imputation steps as specified in the instructions.\n",
