        "I will import `SimpleImputer` and create an instance with a 'median' strategy. Then, I will fit this imputer to the numerical features (`housing_num`) and transform them to handle any missing values, storing the result back into a DataFrame while preserving the column names.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
