    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "87538f02"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "Now that missing values in numerical features have been handled, I will identify the numerical and categorical column names from `housing_features` to prepare for building the data pipelines. I will then set up the numerical and categorical processing pipelines and combine them into a `ColumnTransformer` to create the full data preparation pipeline. Finally, I will fit and transform the `housing_features` using this `full_pipeline` to obtain the fully prepared training data.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "41e08028",
        "outputId": "12f243a9-af3d-4f42-edf6-042d73b0b41a"
      },
      "source": [
        "from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n",
        "from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler, OneHotEncoder\n",
        "from sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer\n",
        "\n",
        "# Identify numerical and categorical column names\n",
        "num_attribs = list(housing_num.columns)\n",
        "cat_attribs = [\"ocean_proximity\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create numerical pipeline\n",
        "num_pipeline = Pipeline([\n",
        "    ('imputer', SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n",
        "    ('std_scaler', StandardScaler()),\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create categorical pipeline\n",
        "cat_pipeline = Pipeline([\n",
        "    ('one_hot', OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown='ignore')),\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "# Combine numerical and categorical pipelines using ColumnTransformer\n",
        "full_pipeline = ColumnTransformer([\n",
        "    (\"num\", num_pipeline, num_attribs),\n",
        "    (\"cat\", cat_pipeline, cat_attribs),\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "# Fit and transform the training features\n",
        "housing_prepared = full_pipeline.fit_transform(housing_features)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Full data preparation pipeline created and applied.\")\n",
        "print(f\"Shape of housing_prepared: {housing_prepared.shape}\")"
      ],
